<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400">
    <tr valign="top" height="400">
        <td tEditID="c1r1" style="background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0">
            <![CDATA[
            <p class="MsoNormal" style="">
                <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">
                    <span style="line-height: 115%;">Hi </span>
                    <span style="line-height: 18.4px;">{!Contact.NSP_Preferred_First_Name__c},</span>
                    <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span>
                </font>
            </p>
            <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><br></p>
            <p class="MsoNormal" style="">
                <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">
                    Your annual benefits open enrollment is upon us! Based on our records your benefits plan year begins on 
                    <span style="line-height: 115%; color: red;">{Benefits Renewal Date}</span>.
                </font>
            </p>
            <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><br></p>
            <p class="MsoNormal" style="">
                <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">
                    I will be working directly with you to configure your new plan year changes and set up open enrollment. Once you have reviewed the renewal documents sent to you from Insperity Insurance Services and signed off on them, 
                    <b>please let me know</b> so that I can make the necessary updates in iSolved to the benefit plans.
                </font>
            </p>
            <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><br></p>
            <p class="MsoNormal" style="">
                <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">
                    Do you plan to use isolved for open enrollment? If so, typically we would like to start this as soon as possible so new cards can be mailed out before the new plan year begins. If not, I'm happy to show you how to enter your employees’ enrolments manually so that their payroll deductions are correct for the new plan year.
                </font>
            </p>
            <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><br></p>
            <p class="MsoNormal" style="">
                <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">Next Steps:</font>
            </p>
            <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><br></p>
            <ul style="margin-top: 0in;" type="disc">
                <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in">
                    <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">
                        Sign off on new rates/plans from IIS and <b>let me know you have done so</b>
                    </font>
                </li>
                <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in">
                    <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">
                        I will configure iSolved
                    </font>
                </li>
                <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in">
                    <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">
                        I will send an export to you from iSolved with the updated information to sign off on
                    </font>
                </li>
                <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in">
                    <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">
                        We will set up a call to review the employee enrollment portal and any questions you have about the iSolved enrollment process
                    </font>
                </li>
                <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in">
                    <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">
                        Open Enrollment starts in iSolved for the dates you choose
                    </font>
                </li>
                <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in">
                    <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">
                        You will approve all benefits once the Open Enrollment Closes, and let me know once you have done so
                    </font>
                </li>
                <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in">
                    <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">
                        I will make sure carriers are updated via Insperity Insurance Services
                    </font>
                </li>
            </ul>
            <div style="">
                <span style="line-height: 115%;">
                    <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">
                        If you have any questions, do not hesitate to reach out to me via email or phone, I'm always happy to help!
                    </font>
                </span>
            </div>
            <font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;">
                <span style="color:red"></span>
            </font>
            <p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"></p>
            ]]>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>